Z||000009||saleenfiero||07-30-2001||11:37 AM||||Okay get this:  We have a '90 Sunbird 3.1.  Took it in to get tuned up, no biggie and to get a computer check or something on it done.  We come pick up the car, start it and begin to leave, engine conks out.  Turns out someone at Canadian Tire dropped a little hez screw or something into the open engine.  Destroyed the top end.  Needless to say, our faith in that place is not exactly 100%.||||reg||1
